# Local development secrets for VCare — template only (safe to commit).
#
# 1. Copy this file to `.env` in the project root (`.env` is git-ignored).
# 2. Put your Gemini API key after the `=` (no quotes needed).
#
# The VS Code launch configurations pass this file to Flutter with
# `--dart-define-from-file=.env`, which is what `EnvConfig` reads via
# String.fromEnvironment('GEMINI_API_KEY'). Leave the value empty and the
# app runs normally with the AI Assistant reporting "not configured".
#
# Manual equivalent:  flutter run -d chrome --dart-define-from-file=.env
GEMINI_API_KEY=
